        {"class": "DepictionLabelView", "text": "ColorSubstitute", "fontWeight": "semibold", "fontSize": 17, "useMargins": true, "margins": "{10,0,10,0}"},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "useRawFormat": true, "markdown": "把 **Face ID 动画**染成任意单色——基于 82Flex 原版源码的定制版，注入 CoreAuthUI，使用系统单色滤镜，**不联网、不采集任何数据**。"},
        {"class": "DepictionSpacerView"},
        {"class": "DepictionLabelView", "text": "功能", "fontWeight": "semibold", "fontSize": 16, "useMargins": true, "margins": "{10,0,10,0}"},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "useRawFormat": true, "markdown": "- 设置 → ColorSubstitute 面板：总开关 + HEX 颜色输入\n- **系统取色器**：色轮 / 滑杆 / 吸管选任意颜色（拖动实时生效，任何方式关闭都不丢色）\n- 默认色 `#F483D1` 樱花粉；非法 HEX 自动回退默认\n- 改动即时生效：Face ID 下次唤醒即用新色；关闭开关恢复原生彩色动画\n- 配置写入越狱隐根 Preferences，不会被 var 清理误删"},
        {"class": "DepictionSpacerView"},
        {"class": "DepictionLabelView", "text": "0.4.0 更新", "fontWeight": "semibold", "fontSize": 16, "useMargins": true, "margins": "{10,0,10,0}"},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "useRawFormat": true, "markdown": "- 移除预设色板，面板更精简（手输 HEX + 系统取色器双通道已够用）\n- 修复取色器选色不生效（轮询保证通道，回调不触发也能拿到颜色）\n- 设置面板新增 Face ID 图标"},
        {"class": "DepictionSpacerView"},
        {"class": "DepictionLabelView", "text": "安装", "fontWeight": "semibold", "fontSize": 16, "useMargins": true, "margins": "{10,0,10,0}"},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "useRawFormat": true, "markdown": "RootHide 设备选 `iphoneos-arm64e` 版本；rootless/Dopamine 选 `iphoneos-arm`。安装后注销或重启用户空间一次（CoreAuthUI 需重载插件）。"},
        {"class": "DepictionSpacerView"},
